# ═══ AI labels + short descriptions (optional) ═══════════════════════
# Without any key, ClosedTabs still saves links, titles, descriptions and
# page text, and search works. Labels need ONE of the options below.
# After changing this file, restart ClosedTabs.

# ── Option A: Claude ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Key: https://platform.claude.com → API keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Default claude-opus-5-5 (best quality, ~1–2 cents per link).
# Cheaper: claude-haiku-5-5 (about 40x cheaper per token).
CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# ── Option B: any other AI (Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral, Groq, OpenRouter, Ollama…) ──
# Works with any provider that offers an "OpenAI-compatible" API. Fill in all three.
# LLM_MODEL must be the exact model name from your provider's model list.
#
#   Gemini   LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
#            key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey   models: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models
#   OpenAI   LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
#   Mistral  LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.mistral.ai/v1
#   Groq     LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   OpenRouter LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   Ollama (free, on your computer, no key):
#            LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1            (with start-local.sh)
#            LLM_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:11434/v1 (with Docker / start.sh)
LLM_BASE_URL=
LLM_API_KEY=
LLM_MODEL=

# ── If you filled in BOTH A and B ────────────────────────────────────
# claude = use Claude (default)   other = use Option B
AI_PROVIDER=claude

# ═══ Obsidian (optional) ═════════════════════════════════════════════
# Two-way sync with your Obsidian vault: the full path of the vault folder
# (the folder that contains the .obsidian folder). ClosedTabs writes into a
# "ClosedTabs" subfolder there. Leave empty to switch off.
# Tip: in Finder, right-click the vault folder, hold Option, "Copy … as Pathname".
# Put the path in double quotes, e.g. OBSIDIAN_VAULT="/Users/me/Obsidian/My Vault"
OBSIDIAN_VAULT=
# OBSIDIAN_FOLDER=ClosedTabs
